,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.47,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -21 16 l -13 6 l -35 5 l -13 5 l -20 -4Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.47,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -21 16 l -13 6 l -35 5 l -13 5 l -20 -4Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.47,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -21 16 l -13 6 l -35 5 l -13 5 l -20 -4Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.47,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -21 16 l -13 6 l -35 5 l -13 5 l -20 -4Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.47,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -21 16 l -13 6 l -35 5 l -13 5 l -20 -4Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.47,Karaoke-OP5,,0,0,0,fx,m -12 4 l -12 -18 l -10 4 l -1 -5 l -9 5 l 9 5 l -9 7 l -2 14 l -10 8 l -10 27 l -12 8 l -21 16 l -13 6 l -35 5 l -13 5 l -20 -4Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:08.05,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Hand in hand, we convey our powerDialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come trueDialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Combining our strengths, we'll crest these surging seasDialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,1,,Hurry toward the thrill of danger— Let the adventure begin!Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Now's the time to set sail; raise the anchorDialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Off to the seas of adventure, through rainbow-colored windsDialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:58.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Our journey's fraught with injuryDialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.27,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,But what we cherish most is right at our sideDialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.35,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And if you get into a jamDialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,I'll always be there to protect youDialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,It's all right! It's time to move onDialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:16.82,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,The sun shines always in our heartsDialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:20.33,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,Shoulder to shoulder, we face all coming stormsDialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:24.20,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And look to the future for the light of hopeDialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:27.92,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,If we gather up the pieces of our dreamsDialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:31.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,They'll make a chart leading to tomorrowDialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.72,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,We come together under the same Jolly RogerDialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:40.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,And make our wishes come true; together, we are...Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.18,0:02:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Go get more food!Dialogue: 5,0:02:04.45,0:02:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got money now!Dialogue: 5,0:02:06.30,0:02:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The booze is better than ever!Dialogue: 5,0:02:37.12,0:02:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give 'em hell, every last one of them!Dialogue: 5,0:02:47.11,0:02:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure 'bout that?Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.35,0:02:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Read 'em and weep!Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.40,0:02:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like yer buyin' the grub!Dialogue: 5,0:02:52.40,0:02:56.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buy up everything at the store, okay?!  We got the money!Dialogue: 5,0:03:02.60,0:03:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, damn! Don't go nowhere,  'cause I'll win next time!Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.88,0:03:14.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:03:27.22,0:03:29.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! What was that?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.41,0:03:37.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell're you?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 5,0:03:55.54,0:03:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 5,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.71,0:04:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So ya thought you'd come get yer money back, huh? How stupid!Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.15,0:04:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see all of us? What could the four of ya possibly do?Dialogue: 5,0:04:24.11,0:04:28.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, here you are.  Word is, you got a bounty on yer head.Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So why not leave yer head with us?Dialogue: 5,0:04:31.70,0:04:34.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's that long-nosed wimp's captain!Dialogue: 5,0:04:36.10,0:04:39.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he can't be that tough!Dialogue: 5,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, short stuff!Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.35,0:04:52.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:04:55.10,0:04:56.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?Dialogue: 5,0:04:57.96,0:05:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's using his bare fists? A battleship wouldn't make a dent in that thick steel armor! Dialogue: 5,0:05:03.50,0:05:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a joke!Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.70,0:05:10.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're just gonna fool around, I'll go ahead and crush you.Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.80,0:05:29.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cannon!Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.60,0:05:46.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-He busted right through  that thick armor!Dialogue: 5,0:05:46.95,0:05:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:05:49.10,0:05:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Now wait a minute, guys!  Let's talk things over!Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.66,0:05:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's talk...Dialogue: 5,0:05:55.23,0:05:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's... Let's...Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's fire the cannons!Dialogue: 5,0:05:58.82,0:06:00.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!Dialogue: 5,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style:Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.35,0:06:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dire Raven...Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.80,0:06:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hunt!Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.19,0:06:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-These cannonballs are made of iron, ya know!Dialogue: 5,0:06:38.01,0:06:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the cannon?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.67,0:06:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bad news! These guys are seriously bad news!Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.13,0:06:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,L-Let's scram!  Get out through the back door!Dialogue: 5,0:06:55.41,0:07:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You picked this fight. Don't even think about backin' out.Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Party Table...Dialogue: 5,0:07:03.23,0:07:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kick Course!Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Back door's a no-go!Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The windows! Try the windows!Dialogue: 5,0:07:23.25,0:07:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rumble!Dialogue: 5,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Horn Point!Dialogue: 5,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roseo Colonnade!Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.87,0:07:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait a sec, you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.61,0:07:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the money, right?!  That's what you want!Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.71,0:07:55.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The 200 million belly  that loser had, right?Dialogue: 5,0:07:55.03,0:07:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that money ain't here no more!Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.00,0:08:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our boss, Big Bro Franky,  took the money and went shopping.Dialogue: 5,0:08:03.59,0:08:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's workin' a black-market deal, so he could be anywhere by now!Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.91,0:08:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Basically, even if you go berserk here,Dialogue: 5,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that 200 million belly won't come ba–Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.51,0:08:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh!Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Zambai!Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.01,0:08:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop running your mouth.  This was never about the money.Dialogue: 5,0:08:23.60,0:08:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's too late.Dialogue: 5,0:08:31.45,0:08:34.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna break every last bone in your bodies.Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every last bone?Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.35,0:08:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Don't let 'im scare you!Dialogue: 5,0:08:38.50,0:08:40.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Break every last bone."Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.13,0:08:44.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's our line! We're the Franky Family, professional dismantlers and bounty hunters! Dialogue: 5,0:08:44.67,0:08:48.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show them the Franky House specialty!Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.00,0:08:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything Goes Cannon!Dialogue: 5,0:09:05.70,0:09:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here they come! Take 'em out!Dialogue: 5,0:09:07.99,0:09:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Stand tall!  Keep firing until we run out of projectiles!Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.79,0:09:13.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There're only four of 'em!Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.40,0:09:32.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.14,0:09:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're those noises? Fireworks?Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.45,0:09:38.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's from the northeast!  In the direction of the Franky House!Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.51,0:09:42.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Them again? What's the fuss about this time?Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.34,0:09:45.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it– Shh! He'll hear us!Dialogue: 5,0:09:48.69,0:09:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, great. They gonna tear the place apart.Dialogue: 5,0:09:51.50,0:09:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It sure as hell ain't no cocktail party.Dialogue: 5,0:09:56.49,0:10:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's okay once in a while, right?  Today's a special day!Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.29,0:10:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should we go after Franky?Dialogue: 5,0:10:20.30,0:10:21.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where would he be?Dialogue: 5,0:10:23.01,0:10:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a pain. Looks like they really  don't know where the money is.Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.33,0:10:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we string up this Franky guy,  he might've already spent the money.Dialogue: 5,0:10:33.61,0:10:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What now? We can wait around,  but he might not be back for a while.Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.37,0:10:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I finished giving him first aid!Dialogue: 5,0:10:40.94,0:10:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need him on a stretcher.  Give me a hand!Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.74,0:10:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't figure it out here.Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.96,0:10:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the ship for now.  Nami-san's all alone there.Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's also Robin-chan...Dialogue: 5,0:10:53.29,0:10:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the issues with the ship too.Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.89,0:10:56.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.30,0:11:04.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,About the ship.Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.01,0:11:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.31,0:11:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've decided.Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.42,0:11:20.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is where we say goodbye to the Going Merry.Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.52,0:11:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll be on my way.Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.70,0:11:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how stubborn that guy is.Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.23,0:11:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't even know if he has it,Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.99,0:11:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they keep sending me out here anyway.Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish they'd put  themselves in my shoes.Dialogue: 5,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Kalifa.Dialogue: 5,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, come in.Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.91,0:11:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be worn out, Iceburg-san.Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.50,0:11:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something to drink?Dialogue: 5,0:11:58.19,0:12:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:12:01.39,0:12:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Today, tea would be–Dialogue: 5,0:12:03.39,0:12:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Already brewed.Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.12,0:12:08.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, um, that's just like you, Kalifa.Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.85,0:12:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Corgi tends to leave  in a bad mood, doesn't he?Dialogue: 5,0:12:16.99,0:12:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the world does he come to ask you?Dialogue: 5,0:12:19.50,0:12:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, that.Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.84,0:12:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He wants something I have,  so he comes to persuade me to give it up.Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.40,0:12:29.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be something very precious, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.85,0:12:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, well, I just tell him I don't know  what he's talking about and say bye.Dialogue: 5,0:12:35.55,0:12:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's such a pain in the butt.Dialogue: 5,0:12:39.98,0:12:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.95,0:12:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Usopp woke up!Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.82,0:12:48.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?! That's great!Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.90,0:12:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now we can relax a little.Dialogue: 5,0:12:55.36,0:12:56.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:13:02.60,0:13:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan isn't back yet.Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.59,0:13:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you shouldn't worry us like that!Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.80,0:13:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's right. Taking them on alone was reckless.Dialogue: 5,0:13:15.49,0:13:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're lucky to be alive.Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think before you act next time.Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.89,0:13:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking!Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.90,0:13:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being such a screw-up!Dialogue: 5,0:13:29.74,0:13:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean it. I'm such a failure!Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.66,0:13:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.87,0:13:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That money meant so much,  and I let it... I let it...Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.77,0:13:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait! Cool it!Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I get it already, let go!Dialogue: 5,0:13:44.38,0:13:48.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No really, we went through so much to get that money and I...Dialogue: 5,0:13:48.93,0:13:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you should still be in bed.Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.90,0:13:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you need to listen to Chopper.Dialogue: 5,0:13:57.30,0:13:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then that's that.Dialogue: 5,0:13:59.66,0:14:02.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The money is gone for good.Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.50,0:14:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we won't know for sure  until this Franky guy comes back.Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.55,0:14:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. I'm sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:14:10.24,0:14:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But even if we don't get it back,  we still have 100 million belly.Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's okay. No worries.Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.00,0:14:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not okay! That's our money!Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.54,0:14:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Nami.  – Ah! My bad.Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.80,0:14:27.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, she's right.Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.30,0:14:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Luffy, what about the ship?  What about the Merry?Dialogue: 5,0:14:31.30,0:14:34.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will the remaining 100 million  be enough for her repairs?Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.15,0:14:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're lucky we're at a first-class shipyard that can fix her up.Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.52,0:14:43.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have to refit her so she can weather the seas ahead.Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.61,0:14:45.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, about that.Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.53,0:14:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're getting a new ship.Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.80,0:14:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry I didn't talk to you about it first,Dialogue: 5,0:14:51.45,0:14:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I've already made up my mind.Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.60,0:14:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Going Merry took good care of us,  but our journey with her ends here.Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.65,0:15:08.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway...Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.28,0:15:12.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I took a look at the catalog Iceboss gave us.Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.22,0:15:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, There's loads of different ships to check out in here.Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.99,0:15:20.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we go with a used one,  100 million should get us...Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a way bigger ship.Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.65,0:15:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. You're taking this joke a little too far.Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right?Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.80,0:15:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, look!  Chopper's taking it seriously.Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.89,0:15:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really though,  someone tell our captain to cut it out already.Dialogue: 5,0:15:37.59,0:15:40.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say something to him, Nami.Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.70,0:15:48.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So then... we really don't...  have enough money to repair her?Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.42,0:15:53.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's because I let them steal the 200 million, isn't it?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:53.00,0:15:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's what's going on, right, Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.23,0:15:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, a world-class shipyard would charge premium prices, so...Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.50,0:16:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! That's not it!Dialogue: 5,0:16:00.18,0:16:04.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then what is it?! Spit it out!  Are you sugarcoating this for my sake?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:04.73,0:16:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not! This has nothing to do  with the money getting stolen!Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.82,0:16:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then why the harebrained plan to get a new ship?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it, you two!Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.24,0:16:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What good will bickering do?  Calm down, then talk!Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.41,0:16:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can I calm down after hearing this bullshit?! Dialogue: 5,0:16:21.79,0:16:25.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I get this is important,  but you shouldn't get so worked up.Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.23,0:16:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's right, Usopp.  You'll get worse if you don't take it easy.Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.20,0:16:30.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So then I get worse!Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.99,0:16:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can I relax when Captain Loudmouth  wants to get a new ship?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:34.61,0:16:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong!  I thought this through!Dialogue: 5,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And this  is what you came up with?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:41.28,0:16:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you spout off while waving around this thing ?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.15,0:16:46.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.85,0:16:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It pissed me off. Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.50,0:16:52.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me Luffy, if it's not about the stolen money, then what is it about?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.50,0:16:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, just say it already!  Hey! Why won't you tell me?!Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.49,0:16:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back, no matter how much it stings!Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.72,0:17:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say it! Why should I go along with this, huh?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Merry can't...Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.80,0:17:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was... What did you just say?Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.86,0:17:23.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make me repeat myself.Dialogue: 5,0:17:23.45,0:17:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Merry... can't be repaired.Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.80,0:17:29.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's just... no way to fix her.Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.78,0:17:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there were,  we wouldn't be talking about this.Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.15,0:17:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ship?! You mean the ship we're aboard right now?!Dialogue: 5,0:17:39.99,0:17:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. This ship won't last much longer.Dialogue: 5,0:17:46.46,0:17:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you saying... Luffy?Dialogue: 5,0:17:48.80,0:17:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the truth. They told us at the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:17:53.89,0:17:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They said she won't  even reach the next island.Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.00,0:18:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so? She won't, huh?Dialogue: 5,0:18:00.28,0:18:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just met these guys today,  and they've already convinced you to walk away?Dialogue: 5,0:18:04.41,0:18:06.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say what?Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.00,0:18:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get that these top-notch shipwrights  gave you their assessment, but...Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.90,0:18:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you gave up just like that?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:13.89,0:18:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've traveled together all this time!Dialogue: 5,0:18:16.54,0:18:18.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Past every wave! Through every battle!Dialogue: 5,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carried us through hell and high water!Dialogue: 5,0:18:21.68,0:18:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you're just gonna abandon our dear crewmate in a place like this?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:28.90,0:18:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's it... Is that how little  this ship means to you, Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.59,0:18:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't shout like that, Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Please, step aside.  – What?Dialogue: 5,0:18:43.60,0:18:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I haven't gotten through to him yet.Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.95,0:18:52.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, so you know better than them?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.62,0:18:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have our own shipwright.  That's why we got those guys to check her out!Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.50,0:19:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it, but asking guys like them to fix her is pointless!Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.70,0:19:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll do it like I always have.Dialogue: 5,0:19:05.88,0:19:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, that's how we made it this far.Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.79,0:19:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! No time like the present!  Give me a hand, you guys!Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.50,0:19:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.10,0:19:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, we don't have enough lumber.  I'll go buy some at the shipyard.Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.13,0:19:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, we've got a lot to do.Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.18,0:19:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, You're not a shipwright, Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:19:23.60,0:19:24.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:19:25.80,0:19:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. So what?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.10,0:19:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, I don't trust shady shipwrights who abuse their position...Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.39,0:19:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and write things off because it's "just another ship" to them!Dialogue: 5,0:19:37.25,0:19:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp.Dialogue: 5,0:19:38.66,0:19:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The lesson here?  We need to look out for the ship ourselves.Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.29,0:19:48.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up on this ship!Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.84,0:19:50.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you lose your minds?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.60,0:19:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all got taken in by those smooth-talking shipwrights, didn't you?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.80,0:19:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Luffy I know wouldn't have fallen for some sales pitch.Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.92,0:20:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He would've been the first to believe in the Merry's strength!Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.72,0:20:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you didn't hesitate.  Like you're some wise geezer with all the answers.Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.81,0:20:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of captain makes  snap decisions like that?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.79,0:20:12.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was wrong about you, Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.36,0:20:14.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, Usopp! Luffy thought the same–Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.80,0:20:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Nami!  This is something I decided!Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.35,0:20:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't budge. No matter what you say, we're getting a new ship!Dialogue: 5,0:20:22.44,0:20:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We say goodbye to the Merry here!Dialogue: 5,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like hell we do! I can't accept that!Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.78,0:20:31.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy! Not everyone shares your carefree attitude!Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.25,0:20:35.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave our wounded friend here  and move on to the seas ahead!Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.92,0:20:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that! Friend or not, humans and ships are different!Dialogue: 5,0:20:39.60,0:20:42.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the same!  Merry still has some fight in her!Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.99,0:20:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But knowing you,Dialogue: 5,0:20:44.27,0:20:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're probably just excited about getting a new ship.Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.17,0:20:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend to care about the Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:20:49.43,0:20:50.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough already!Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.93,0:20:52.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.06,0:20:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one hurting over this!Dialogue: 5,0:20:54.29,0:20:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone here feels the same!Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.94,0:20:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that's true, there's no way  you'd get a new ship!Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.48,0:21:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine! If you hate how I run things,  you should just lea–Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.13,0:21:08.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 5,0:21:14.61,0:21:19.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damn idiot. What were you about to say?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.21,0:21:23.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cool down! You might end up saying something you'll regret! Got it, Luffy?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.89,0:21:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I just...Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.99,0:21:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's okay, Luffy.  That's probably how you really feel.Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.50,0:21:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.38,0:21:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just get rid of the useless crewmates that hold you back.Dialogue: 5,0:21:48.36,0:21:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna abandon the Merry,Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.40,0:21:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,why not do the same with me?!Dialogue: 5,0:21:53.29,0:21:56.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp. Quit talking like that.Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.71,0:21:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I'm serious.Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.90,0:22:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been on my mind for a while.Dialogue: 5,0:22:02.74,0:22:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To be honest,Dialogue: 5,0:22:04.10,0:22:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking that I can't keep up  with how monstrous you all are.Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.13,0:22:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like today, I couldn't even guard the money.Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.47,0:22:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll just continue to be  a burden on you guys.Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.39,0:22:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't need weak crew members, right?Dialogue: 5,0:22:26.40,0:22:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you're the man  who'll be king of the pirates.Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.89,0:22:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I don't have such high ambitions.Dialogue: 5,0:22:36.71,0:22:43.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thinking back on it, I was about to sail off on my own when you invited me to join you.Dialogue: 5,0:22:53.19,0:22:54.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all that binds us.Dialogue: 5,0:22:57.30,0:23:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can't see eye to eye,  then why should we travel together?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.08,0:23:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, where're you going, Usopp?!Dialogue: 5,0:23:06.78,0:23:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where I'm going is my own business.Dialogue: 5,0:23:09.20,0:23:12.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It has nothing to do with you guys anymore.Dialogue: 5,0:23:13.64,0:23:14.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 5,0:23:18.08,0:23:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,leaving the crew.Dialogue: 5,0:23:41.50,0:23:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why... Why aren't you saying anything?Dialogue: 5,0:23:47.15,0:23:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:23:49.86,0:23:52.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! This is all wrong!Dialogue: 5,0:23:52.78,0:23:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Turn around!Dialogue: 5,0:23:54.57,0:23:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!Dialogue: 5,0:23:56.20,0:23:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:24:02.84,0:24:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!Dialogue: 5,0:24:06.09,0:24:07.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 5,0:24:16.40,0:24:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I can't follow you anymore.Dialogue: 5,0:24:21.60,0:24:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry I dragged you down till the end.Dialogue: 5,0:24:26.69,0:24:30.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I realize the ship  belongs to you, the captain.Dialogue: 5,0:24:32.50,0:24:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So fight me for her.Dialogue: 5,0:24:34.90,0:24:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:24:44.60,0:24:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a duel!Dialogue: 5,0:24:53.88,0:24:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What? Um, hey, what're you saying?!Dialogue: 5,0:24:59.50,0:25:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At 10 o'clock tonight, I'll come back here.Dialogue: 5,0:25:04.77,0:25:07.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we'll have a duel for the Merry!Dialogue: 5,0:25:07.90,0:25:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll defeat you and take her!Dialogue: 5,0:25:10.80,0:25:11.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then,Dialogue: 5,0:25:12.38,0:25:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there'll be nothing left to bind us.Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.69,0:15:21.28,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it.Dialogue: 5,0:20:45.64,0:20:47.05,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't work this out...Dialogue: 5,0:20:47.05,0:20:49.43,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,if you're all fired up!Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.34,0:01:56.22,Title,,0,0,0,,ImpasseDialogue: 1,0:01:51.34,0:01:56.22,Title,,0,0,0,,Impasse